# Test fixtures are captured tool output (Playwright, Lighthouse, Vitest, gh API
# payloads) or deliberately malformed input. Tests parse them as recorded, and
# reformatting them breaks other gates (html-validate rejects Prettier's HTML
# serialisation of the Playwright report) or fails outright on the invalid
# JSON, so Prettier leaves them byte-for-byte (#1361).
tests/fixtures/
tests/python/fixtures/

# Generated by scripts/ci/catalog/render.py and checked byte-for-byte by the
# support-catalog gate; the generator, not Prettier, owns its layout (#1361).
docs/catalog.md

# YAML is owned by yamllint and actionlint (#1361). Prettier's YAML printer
# requotes scalars that the Renovate regex managers and contract tests match
# verbatim, explodes flow sequences away from their `yamllint disable-line`
# pragmas, and rewrites the blocks scripts/ci/workflows/sync_ai_review_matrix.py
# generates inside reusable-ai-review.yml.
*.yml
*.yaml
